WEBVTT

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:02.059
"Nathan Bird was lynched
near Luling, Texas,

00:13:02.083 --> 00:13:05.375
for refusing to turn his son
over to a mob."

00:13:06.417 --> 00:13:08.768
We need to change the action,

00:13:08.792 --> 00:13:10.643
whether that action is "lynches"

00:13:10.667 --> 00:13:12.726
or "calls police."

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:16.268
And now that I have shortened
the distance between those two,

00:13:16.292 --> 00:13:18.976
let's get back to our game,
to our mission.

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:22.018
Our objective in level three
is to change the action.

00:13:22.042 --> 00:13:23.851
So what if, instead of

00:13:23.875 --> 00:13:26.809
"Calls Cops On Black Woman
Donating Food To Homeless,"

00:13:26.833 --> 00:13:29.417
that California Safeway simply thanks her.